{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お帰りなさいヾ(*・∀・*)ノ゛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日お疲れちま*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪まで後4日..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに会えるのが楽しみです+*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/24/6884792/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみっ楽しみっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も学校終わって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間があったから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなお散歩をしてきたの(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもよりも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったかくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちよかったぁー＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホッケを夜ご飯で食べて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せらんらんな1日でしたжжж..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お魚大好きっ\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にお答えしまーす／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.握手会で定期入れ渡したけど、届いた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→はい!届きました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます+"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切にしてます＊*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.身長何センチ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→158センチになったよー☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.野球とサッカーどっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→運動が大好きだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも好き!でも、日奈自身はあまりできないから、応援専門!!∵"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4.好きな鯛焼き屋さんはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→特定の鯛焼き屋さんはないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこに行っても、鯛焼き屋さんには敏感に反応しちゃいます\"\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5.エスカルゴいけそう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→実はエスカルゴまだ食べたことないんです(__)でもいけると思う!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6.3姉妹の顔立ちは似てるって言われる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→1コ上のお姉ちゃんとは、よく間違われます(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7.日奈が初めて街で声掛けられた人はどんな人だった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→乃木坂イベントにも来てくださる方で日奈も、「あっ」て気付きました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8.もし見かけたら声かけて良い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→良いですよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっでも、学校帰りとかで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっぴんちゃんかもしれません(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9.香水何つけてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→香水はつけてないですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボディミストはつけてます*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、お気に入りは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャンプーの香りです＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10.名古屋名物ジャンボ味噌かつ定食知ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→味噌かつは知ってるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンボは知らない!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボリューミーなんだろうなぁ.・〇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11.なにかムカッてして、怒ったりする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ムカッということは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまりないの..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、マナー違反とかしてる人見ると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「コラー!!」と叱りたくなりますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12.鯛焼きは頭と尻尾どっちから食べる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→尻尾!!尻尾はクリームが付いてないから、尻尾をちぎってから、お腹の方のクリームにつけて食べる＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13.みなみのブログのひなとの2ショットの写メ、本人？表情かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→そうだよー!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、こんな顔でしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14.何で乃木坂入ったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→習っていたダンスの先生に勧められ、日奈自身もやりたい!挑戦したいっ!と思ったからです＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15.普段何時に寝てるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→レッスン終わって帰って、宿題やって寝るときは...2時すぎるかな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもお休みの日は、22時くらいに寝ちゃうよぉー〇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16.年子のお姉さんと仲が良いのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→基本、仲良しです★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17.クラスのみんなは、日奈のこと何て呼んでる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ひなちま・ちま・ひな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って呼ばれてまーす//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18.写メ毎回加工してるけど、自分でしてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→はい♪そうです＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"19.衣装の水玉は何色？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ピンクです*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/nina_resize.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーん(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上でおーわり♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手紙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんありがとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても嬉しいんです(●・・●)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text"